WEBVTT

00:07:27.436 --> 00:07:30.156
That's that feeling
of really being there with others.

00:07:30.156 --> 00:07:32.156
And our brains don't know the difference

00:07:32.156 --> 00:07:34.996
between virtual reality
and reality reality

00:07:35.036 --> 00:07:36.596
when it comes to copresence,

00:07:36.636 --> 00:07:40.716
so we can be together psychologically,
even when we're apart.

00:07:40.756 --> 00:07:44.236
And this enables
social creativity to thrive.

00:07:44.236 --> 00:07:46.556
The second magic I is interaction.

00:07:47.556 --> 00:07:51.036
And interaction is where you can
manipulate things within your environment

00:07:51.076 --> 00:07:52.356
that isn't really there.

00:07:53.716 --> 00:07:56.356
So when we design physical products,

00:07:56.356 --> 00:07:58.996
we imagine them in 3D,

00:07:59.036 --> 00:08:01.036
we produce them in 3D.